        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Nochnye Snaipery\n- People: Diana Arbenina, Svetlana Surganova\n- Places: Valozhyn, Minsk Oblast, Belarus SSR, Chechen Republic\n- Topics: Russian rock music\n\nFacts:\n- Nochnye Snaipery is a Russian rock group.\n- Nochnye Snaipery was founded in 1993 as an acoustic female duo of Diana Arbenina and Svetlana Surganova.\n- Diana Sergeyevna Arbenina, née Kulachenko, was born on July 8, 1974, in Valozhyn, Minsk Oblast, Belarus SSR.\n- Diana Arbenina is a Russian singer, musician, poet, and the leader of the rock group Nochniye Snaiperi.\n- Diana Arbenina was named Honored Artist of the Chechen Republic in 2005.",
